stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> closed
  closed --> open_clean: open
  open_clean --> open_burning: edit / scan / fire / merge
  open_burning --> open_consistent: extinguish + verify
  open_consistent --> open_clean: commit
  open_clean --> closed: close
  open_burning --> closed: close --discard
  open_consistent --> closed: close --discard

